{
  "lang": "en",
  "film": "The American President",
  "source_rel": "Greatest Acting Monologues Of All Time PART 4/Greatest Acting Monologues Of All Time PART 4.mp4",
  "t_start_global": 3231.74,
  "t_end_global": 3362.28,
  "duration": 130.54,
  "clip": "The American President.mp4",
  "segments": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 5.1,
      "text": "For the last couple of months Senator Rumson has suggested that being president of this country",
      "filename": "segment001.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start": 5.1,
      "end": 7.16,
      "text": "was to a certain extent about character.",
      "filename": "segment002.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start": 7.94,
      "end": 12.1,
      "text": "And although I have not been willing to engage in his attacks on me",
      "filename": "segment003.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start": 12.1,
      "end": 15.28,
      "text": "I've been here three years and three days",
      "filename": "segment004.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start": 16.0,
      "end": 18.08,
      "text": "and I can tell you without hesitation",
      "filename": "segment005.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start": 19.22,
      "end": 21.46,
      "text": "being president of this country",
      "filename": "segment006.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start": 22.24,
      "end": 24.86,
      "text": "is entirely about character.",
      "filename": "segment007.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start": 26.04,
      "end": 26.86,
      "text": "For the record,",
      "filename": "segment008.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start": 27.68,
      "end": 30.96,
      "text": "yes, I am a card-carrying member of the ACLU",
      "filename": "segment009.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start": 31.48,
      "end": 34.26,
      "text": "but the more important question is why aren't you, Bob?",
      "filename": "segment010.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start": 35.18,
      "end": 36.56,
      "text": "Now this is an organization",
      "filename": "segment011.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start": 36.56,
      "end": 40.38,
      "text": "whose sole purpose is to defend the Bill of Rights.",
      "filename": "segment012.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start": 40.48,
      "end": 42.06,
      "text": "So it naturally begs the question",
      "filename": "segment013.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start": 42.06,
      "end": 45.38,
      "text": "why would a senator, his party's most powerful spokesman",
      "filename": "segment014.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start": 45.72,
      "end": 47.26,
      "text": "and a candidate for president",
      "filename": "segment015.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start": 47.26,
      "end": 49.76,
      "text": "choose to reject upholding the Constitution?",
      "filename": "segment016.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start": 50.92,
      "end": 52.56,
      "text": "Now if you can answer that question, folks",
      "filename": "segment017.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start": 52.56,
      "end": 53.68,
      "text": "then you're smarter than I am",
      "filename": "segment018.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start": 53.68,
      "end": 57.88,
      "text": "because I didn't understand it until a few hours ago.",
      "filename": "segment019.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start": 60.52,
      "end": 61.86,
      "text": "America isn't easy.",
      "filename": "segment020.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start": 64.02,
      "end": 66.22,
      "text": "America is advanced citizenship.",
      "filename": "segment021.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start": 66.42,
      "end": 67.68,
      "text": "You've got to want it bad",
      "filename": "segment022.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start": 67.68,
      "end": 69.44,
      "text": "because it's going to put up a fight.",
      "filename": "segment023.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start": 70.24,
      "end": 72.28,
      "text": "It's going to say you want free speech?",
      "filename": "segment024.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start": 72.88,
      "end": 76.1,
      "text": "Let's see you acknowledge a man whose words make your blood boil",
      "filename": "segment025.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start": 76.1,
      "end": 77.66,
      "text": "who's standing center stage",
      "filename": "segment026.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start": 77.66,
      "end": 79.82,
      "text": "and advocating at the top of his lungs",
      "filename": "segment027.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start": 79.82,
      "end": 82.54,
      "text": "that which you would spend a lifetime opposing",
      "filename": "segment028.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start": 82.54,
      "end": 83.6,
      "text": "at the top of yours.",
      "filename": "segment029.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start": 83.88,
      "end": 85.9,
      "text": "You want to claim this land is the land of the free?",
      "filename": "segment030.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "start": 86.42,
      "end": 89.34,
      "text": "Then the symbol of your country cannot just be a flag.",
      "filename": "segment031.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "start": 90.14,
      "end": 92.9,
      "text": "The symbol also has to be one of its citizens",
      "filename": "segment032.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "start": 92.9,
      "end": 96.66,
      "text": "exercising his right to burn that flag in protest.",
      "filename": "segment033.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "start": 97.08,
      "end": 97.92,
      "text": "Now show me that.",
      "filename": "segment034.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "start": 98.2,
      "end": 98.78,
      "text": "Defend that.",
      "filename": "segment035.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "start": 99.06,
      "end": 100.48,
      "text": "Celebrate that in your classrooms.",
      "filename": "segment036.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "start": 101.04,
      "end": 103.86,
      "text": "Then you can stand up and sing about the land of the free.",
      "filename": "segment037.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "start": 104.86,
      "end": 106.94,
      "text": "I've known Bob Rumson for years",
      "filename": "segment038.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "start": 106.94,
      "end": 108.58,
      "text": "and I've been operating under the assumption",
      "filename": "segment039.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "start": 108.58,
      "end": 111.5,
      "text": "that the reason Bob devotes so much time and energy",
      "filename": "segment040.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "start": 111.5,
      "end": 114.16,
      "text": "to shouting at the rain was that he simply didn't get it.",
      "filename": "segment041.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "start": 115.04,
      "end": 115.86,
      "text": "Well, I was wrong.",
      "filename": "segment042.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "start": 116.0,
      "end": 118.16,
      "text": "Bob's problem isn't that he doesn't get it.",
      "filename": "segment043.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "start": 118.48,
      "end": 120.66,
      "text": "Bob's problem is that he can't sell it.",
      "filename": "segment044.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "start": 122.08,
      "end": 124.62,
      "text": "We have serious problems to solve",
      "filename": "segment045.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "start": 124.62,
      "end": 126.9,
      "text": "and we need serious people to solve them.",
      "filename": "segment046.mp4"
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "start": 127.34,
      "end": 130.54,
      "text": "And whatever your particular problem is, I promise you",
      "filename": "segment047.mp4"
    }
  ]
}